<task id="012" project="spaarkeai-compose-fidelity-r4.5">
  <metadata>
    <title>WS-1: open-in-Compose transient drafts projected server-side before mount</title>
    <phase>1 WS-1 One reader</phase>
    <gate>blocked until 011</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies the transient-mount path (`.cs` + `.tsx`) on the `bff-api`/compose hot path so `mountTransient` no longer sets `projection: null`. FULL per root CLAUDE.md §8. Step 9.5 code-review + adr-check run.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Extends the projection-hydration pattern established by 010/011 to the third entry path; reuses the same server reader. No new abstraction.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>W1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits shared `Api/ComposeEndpoints.cs`/`Services/Compose/*` and client `ComposeWorkspace.tsx`/`ComposeEditor.tsx` (`mountTransient`) — the same files 010/011/013 touch. Sequential within group W1.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>011</deps>
    <tags>bff-api,compose</tags>
